G'day all,

        O.K., so I'd just like to say that this is HACK not nethack, but anyway;
My top character on the list below had something weird happen to him. He reached
level 31 (you can in Hack), and then got a wand of wishing from killing a mimic
(I liked that!). So anyway, I made my wishes and made it to about level 32 then
drank a further potion of gain level, and got the message:
        "You feel more experienced. Welcome to experience level 0 <more>
        Your fingertips glow white!"

So anyway, what gives? I decided to check out what was going on. I killed a
tengu, and found that I had gained 3 levels from doing so, and that I had lost a
lot of hit points in the process, and was regaining them very slowly. In other
words it was just as if I WAS a level 3 character! I had 220 odd ht pts but I
could have easily died by being attacked by a Xorn etc, as I couldn't heal very
fast. I drank my remaining potions of gain level and managed to get back to
level 9 but I still couldn't teleport at will because I was below level 10!
I don't like this. It was pretty nasty to discover this little "feature"in the
maze levels, and if it wasn't for 2 scrolls of teleportation I would have died.
As you can see, I finished the game with less than max ht pts, but got a bonus
of (I think) 200 000 pts for clocking the experience level counter.


